&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage proprietary and syndicated data to create and present analyses to position The New York Times to the marketplace and clients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find new ways to tell stories, ideating innovative research initiatives that bring our audience to life in new ways Conduct custom research to uncover audience and product insights to support the creation of insights-driven narratives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
