&lt;p&gt;T Brand Studio is the creative center of excellence and maker studio within NYT Advertising. Inspired by the journalism and innovation of the NY Times, T Brand crafts stories that enable brands to make their mark on the world. Our skilled team of journalists, copywriters, editors, creative directors, designers, videographers, producers, program managers&amp;nbsp; and developers create innovative branded advertising content and custom audio for brands that are embedded in The New York Times platform&amp;nbsp; and its related media offerings.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Copywriter, TBrand Intern is responsible for working with the editorial team in the management and production of executions for T Brand Studio. The Copywriter, TBrand Intern will ensure the strategic alignment of output and ensure it aligns with client objectives. This role will report directly to the Director, Editorial, T Brand Studio. This role supports the editorial team creatively as well as operationally. The right candidate for this position has a proactive mindset and an ability to problem solve in real time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the editorial team on assigned programs, staying in lock-step on both creative and logistical aspects of the project.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the editorial team to clearly communicate project schedules, deliverables and daily/weekly deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess project needs and efficiently identify actionable next steps, with advice from editorial colleagues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to mutli-task, juggling various projects with ease and speed, as well as prioritizing responsibilities to ensure the success of assigned projects.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have a proactive attitude, with the ability to work independently to push projects forward.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share ideas and contribute to the direction of T Brand Studio and NYTA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate support and understanding of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytco.com/mission-and-values/&quot;&gt;our value of journalistic independence&lt;/a&gt; and a strong commitment to our mission to seek the truth and help people understand the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualification:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 6 months of copywriting experience within an academic, professional or extracurricular organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience in copywriting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;REQ-020930&lt;/p&gt;
