&lt;p&gt;T Brand Studio is the creative center of excellence and maker studio within NYT Advertising. Inspired by the journalism and innovation of the NY Times, T Brand crafts stories that enable brands to make their mark on the world. Our skilled team of journalists, copywriters, editors, creative directors, designers, videographers, producers, program managers&amp;nbsp; and developers create innovative branded advertising content and custom audio for brands that are embedded in The New York Times platform&amp;nbsp; and its related media offerings.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
