&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 6 months of academic experience in a creative field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months of professional experience with an online media publication and/or ad agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sophisticated visual aesthetic, a great eye and passion for publishing, news and branded content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
