&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The New York Times is looking for an Engineering Manager to lead the Compute and Storage team in the Data Platform mission. We build, run and scale the shared compute engines, lakehouse storage and connective infrastructure that power our data platform at The Times. Our work enables teams across the company to publish and own data products without managing the infrastructure underneath. You will report to the Senior Engineering Manager of Data Platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role based in our New York City headquarters. You can typically expect to come into the office 2-3+ days/week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of engineers, promoting a culture of collaboration, innovation, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee roadmap execution for our compute, streaming, orchestration and lakehouse storage platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide architecture and technical decisions. Set standards for shared platform code and engine integrations so our systems stay secure, reliable and scalable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track service goals for availability, provisioning speed, pipeline success and query performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong practices for on-call, automation, SLAs and escalation paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the product and engineering teams that build on our platform to turn their needs into self-service capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain budgets, forecasts and a cost attribution model.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytco.com/company/mission-and-values/&quot;&gt;value of journalistic independence&lt;/a&gt; and a strong commitment to our mission to seek the truth and help people understand the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience as an engineering manager, and 4+ years in a technical leadership role working with cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software or data infrastructure engineering experience building scalable and distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running production cloud infrastructure on Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in defining SLOs and SLAs, monitoring and alerting, incident management and operational automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency. Comfortable guiding architecture discussions and reviewing code alongside engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
