&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Overview &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The New York Times is looking for a Lead Product Designer to help us design and prototype compelling A.I. experiences that help curious people understand and engage with the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Lead Product Designer to shape how readers search for information and understand the world through New York Times products — someone with a passion for design, journalism, and technology, as well as experience delivering A.I.-enabled consumer experiences at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The New A.I. Products and Platforms mission is a critical, company-wide initiative tasked with building the next generation of A.I.-powered products to accelerate The New York Times&#39;s essential subscription strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Times operates in a hybrid model, with those based in NYC working in-office two days per week. We plan to speak with all candidates about where they&#39;re based and how they work in a hybrid environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;As a Lead Product Designer, you&#39;ll identify opportunities to use A.I. to address news and information needs through our products&#39; search feature. You&#39;ll use your interaction design and coded prototyping skills to build functional prototypes that gain alignment and drive work forward. You&#39;ll validate that these prototypes meet users&#39; informational needs and align with our brand and journalistic standards. You&#39;ll collaborate with product managers, engineers, user researchers, and editorial partners to ship excellent and performant experiences to the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value an environment of learning and collaboration. You&#39;ll play a leadership role to grow and support more junior design team members. You&#39;ll help promote a &quot;make to think&quot; design culture. You&#39;ll participate in regular design rituals to give and receive critique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;3 1 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create sketches, mockups, user journeys and other UX artifacts to rapidly explore a range of editorial and consumer scenarios and identify promising concepts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Frame different approaches and describe tradeoffs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create functional coded prototypes of A.I.-powered experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Give input to product strategy and concept development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead conversations and help make decisions with the cross-functional team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to the development of design standards and systems around A.I.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent your work to leadership within the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improve the people and process around you by shaping and participating in team and Product Design rituals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrate support and understanding of our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytco.com/company/mission-and-values/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;value of journalistic independence&lt;/a&gt; and a strong commitment to our mission to seek the truth and help people understand the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Deputy Head of Product Design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of experience as a product designer, with recent experience creating coded prototypes using AI-enabled tools and workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of experience with interaction design and prototyping, including a portfolio showing a deep care for micro-interactions, motion, and accessibility best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of experience collaborating, building alignment and communicating clearly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of experience working with user research and data analysis teams to inform product and UX decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3+ years of creating functional prototypes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing features that use generative A.I. to deliver end-user experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience refining A.I.&#39;s tone, format, and behavior to align with brand guidelines, product goals, and quality standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A portfolio of shipped work demonstrating experience working in 0-to-1 environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;afa6e9f8-93a6-47bb-9206-dc36bfd34d06&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with media production workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing or conceptualize large solutions while also aligning user and and business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience balancing multiple goals to achieve an excellent outcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong ability to show design decisions and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
