&lt;li&gt;Brief the NYT Communications Systems team on landing page and event page updates and manage the production timeline for those deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the primary daily contact for external creative vendors and production agencies, under the strategic direction of the Director and Production Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
