&lt;p&gt;As part of the Data and Insights Group (DIG), you will join a large community of experienced analysts. You will partner with Product, Newsroom, Engineering, Design, Marketing, Strategy, Finance and PMO teams across the business. We are looking for a curious and a collaborative team player- someone who understands the value of contribution to a greater whole and the importance of analytic delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role based in our New York City headquarters. You can typically expect to come into the office 3 days/week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create data-driven insights, promote them and lead them into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop centralized reporting dashboards and automated reports to expand access to data and analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write SQL to build pipelines and analyze large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run A/B tests, deliver test insights and advise on future tests and next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise partners on areas of opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate support and understanding of our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytco.com/company/mission-and-values/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;value of journalistic independence&lt;/a&gt; and a commitment to our mission to seek the truth and help people understand the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will report to the Senior Manager, Data and Insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience working with data analytics or data science teams to deliver analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience applying statistical methods to analytical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and experience working with relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one additional scripting language like R or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualization and presenting insights from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and sense of curiosity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience working in big data environments such as BigQuery or Amazon Web Services, querying 10M+ rows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience working in dbt or other data transformation or scheduling tool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience with version control (Github, code review)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience with A/B testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
