&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role, Mission or Department Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Specialist, Global Mobility you will be a critical support member of the Global Mobility team, playing an important role in the smooth execution of our international and domestic assignment programs. You will deliver high-touch support, managing vendor relationships, global relocation, and tax support processes. You will collaborate with team members from HR, Payroll, Finance, and Tax ensuring compliance and a positive employee experience. This position operates on a hybrid model (3 days per week in our New York office) and you will report to the Director of Global Mobility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help prepare cost projections, assignment letters, benefit summaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issue service orders to our external providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow up with assignees on questions and manage their relocation and tax support with our external providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help with the outsourcing of Global Mobility payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate support and understanding of our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytco.com/company/mission-and-values/&quot;&gt; value of journalistic independence&lt;/a&gt; and a commitment to our mission to seek the truth and help people understand the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in Global Mobility, relocation, or immigration coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Workday or similar HRIS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Excel for reporting and cost modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising employees, managers, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Mobility Specialist certification or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing external vendor relationships and invoice/billing reconciliation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience focusing on process improvement and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
