&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The Data Platform mission is to help us use data to answer important questions, power user experiences, and inform strategic decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The New York Times is looking for a Technical Product Manager II to shape product direction for Data Platform&#39;s Compute and Storage team. The team builds shared compute engines, lakehouse storage, and connective infrastructure so engineers can publish and own data products without managing the underlying platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner with engineering, machine learning, analytics, and others across the company to deliver reliable, scalable, easy-to-use capabilities. You will make data infrastructure more accessible and efficient through reusable products for diverse workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role based in our New York City headquarters in Times Square, with an expectation of working onsite 3+ days per week. You will report to the Technical Product Director of Data Platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the strategy for shared compute and storage capabilities, including compute engines, streaming, orchestration, lakehouse storage, and connective infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand platform users&#39; workflows and translate their needs into clear outcomes, requirements, and priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with engineering leaders to scope initiatives, define milestones, manage dependencies and delivery risks, and keep execution aligned with product priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver self-service capabilities that help teams build, publish, and operate data products without managing underlying infrastructure; favor reusable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicate roadmap progress, risks, and tradeoffs to stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guide product lifecycle practices from discovery and iterative delivery through launch, documentation, adoption, and feedback. Support migrations and deprecations with clear user plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrate support for The Times&#39; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytco.com/company/mission-and-values/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;mission and values&lt;/a&gt; and a strong commitment to seeking the truth and helping people understand the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
